  "learnings": [
    "The requested Java 21 target was adjusted to Java 17 because the local verification environment only had JDK 17 installed.",
    "The native Specmatic runtime rejected an unsupported specmatic.reports configuration block, so the sample uses the runtime-generated default reports under build/reports/specmatic/test.",
    "Full schema resiliency required explicit JSON map parsing to avoid Jackson scalar coercion and default error payloads for invalid request bodies.",
    "Actuator endpoint discovery is wired via actuatorUrl, and a runOptions.openapi.filter excludes infra paths (/actuator, /actuator/health, /actuator/mappings, /error) so only the 31 contract operations are counted for coverage.",
    "Verified coverage is 68%; governance is enforced at 65% (backend baseline) to leave margin rather than pinning the threshold to the exact achieved value. 404 and 422 response rows without contract examples remain untested by generated positive flows."
